## Gossip NPC

entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.placements.name.npc=Gossip NPC

entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.name.spriteName=Sprite
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.description.spriteName=SpriteBank ID of this NPC's look. Append "/" and an animation name to also play that animation, e.g. "theo/idle".
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.name.mainDialogIds=Main Dialogs
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.description.mainDialogIds=Comma-separated dialog IDs. One is played per conversation, in order; the progress is kept for the session.
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.name.gossipDialogIds=Gossip Dialogs
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.description.gossipDialogIds=Comma-separated dialog IDs. Once every main dialog has been played, a random one is picked each conversation. With no main dialogs, these are played from the first talk.
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.name.endLevel=End Level
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.description.endLevel=Complete the level right after the last main dialog, without playing gossip dialogs. Has no effect when only gossip dialogs are set.
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.name.flipX=Flip Horizontally
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.description.flipX=Mirror the NPC horizontally.
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.name.flipY=Flip Vertically
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.description.flipY=Mirror the NPC vertically.
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.name.approachWhenTalking=Approach When Talking
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.description.approachWhenTalking=Make the player walk over to this NPC (and turn to face it) before the dialog starts.
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.name.approachDistance=Approach Distance
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.description.approachDistance=Distance in pixels the player walks when "Approach When Talking" is enabled.
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.name.indicatorOffsetX=Indicator Offset X
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.description.indicatorOffsetX=Horizontal offset of the interaction icon.
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.name.indicatorOffsetY=Indicator Offset Y
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.description.indicatorOffsetY=Vertical offset of the interaction icon.
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.name.onlyIfFlag=Only If Flag
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.description.onlyIfFlag=Session flag that must be set for this NPC to be talkable. Empty means always talkable.
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.name.onlyIfFlagInverted=Only If Flag Inverted
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.description.onlyIfFlagInverted=Invert the "Only If Flag" check.
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.name.setFlag=Set Flag
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.description.setFlag=Session flag set once every main dialog has been played. Empty means no flag is set.
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.name.setFlagInverted=Set Flag Inverted
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.description.setFlagInverted=Set the "Set Flag" to false instead of true.
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.name.customFont=Custom Font
entities.CorreWithCare/GossipNPC.attributes.description.customFont=Font name used to render this NPC's dialog. Empty uses the default font.
